msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"Who do you think'll be the next president of the Citizens' Liberal "
"Party⑬Tamiya or Suzuki?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Suzuki, no question. He's got a real good image thanks to that Okinawa "
"resort deal he's been promoting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"On the other hand, Tamiya's been pushing that military expansion bill, even "
"though nobody in Japan really wants that kind of thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"But what if somebody were to launch a nuclear missile at Japan? I heard "
"this new BMD system can protect us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"That's all way too theoretical for me. Who'd even want to attack us anyway? "
"At least the resort would bring some concrete results."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "So, that's why you're betting on Suzuki, eh? Maybe you're right..."
msgstr ""

